Description: S.T.A.L.K.E.R. mod launcher for Linux (OpenXRay)
 CORDON-LINUX manages game profiles and mods for S.T.A.L.K.E.R. games running on the
 OpenXRay engine.  Every profile gets its own overlay directory, its own fsgame.ltx and
 its own save/log directory; the engine is started with -fsltx/-overlaypath so the
 installed game files are never modified.
 .
 Mods are joined with symbolic links by default, or with fuse-overlayfs if the user
 prefers a real overlay mount.  The launcher also offers conflict analysis,
 pre-flight checks and a case sensitivity audit that creates alias links for mods
 shipped with Windows-style file name casing.
